message: "If you use these data or codes, please cite the article and this archive."
title: "FePS3-thermodynamic-constraints: data and code for Three thermodynamic constraints on exchange parameters of FePS3"
type: software
version: 1.0.0
date-released: 2026-11-23
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/nparan83/FePS3-thermodynamic-constraints"
authors:
  - family-names: Paran
    given-names: Nejdet
    affiliation: "Department of Physics, Faculty of Science, Erciyes University, Kayseri, Türkiye"
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0000-0003-0317-0438"
abstract: >-
  Monte Carlo codes (Blume-Capel and classical Heisenberg models), raw Monte Carlo
  outputs, digitized experimental susceptibility curves and the analysis scripts that
  generate every table and figure of the article "Three thermodynamic constraints on
  exchange parameters of FePS3: Neel temperature, longitudinal-susceptibility step and
  spin-flip fields" (N. Paran, submitted to Physical Review B).
keywords:
  - FePS3
  - van der Waals antiferromagnet
  - exchange parameters
  - Monte Carlo
  - Neel temperature
  - magnetic susceptibility
